[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C04_BY_ELECTION]
After the Gunfire

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C04_BY_ELECTION_desc]
Under the Empire’s urging, the Stratusburg Dominion must hold a by-election immediately. Although the Free Stratusburg Movement has unshakable popular support in Stratusburg, who knows what the Empire can do?

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C04_BY_ELECTION]
枪声之后

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C04_BY_ELECTION_desc]
在帝国的催促下，层云堡不得不立即举行补缺选举。虽然在层云堡，自由层云堡运动有着无可撼动的民众支持，但谁知道帝国能做出什么来呢？
